\item Write the first four partial sums of \(\sum 1/[n(n+1)]\).

\item Explain why terms and partial sums use different indices and meanings.

\item Give a series whose terms approach zero but whose partial sums increase.

\item What does it mean for a series to diverge to \(+\infty\)?

